# tor for NOX. Written by the NOX install script once, and then left alone:
# settings of your own belong here. The NOX onion service is in the included
# file, which the script writes again on every run.
#
# No SOCKS port: this tor publishes the onion service and does nothing else.
SocksPort 0
DataDirectory "@DATA_DIR@"
Log notice @LOG_TARGET@
%include "@NOX_CONF@"
